meta {
  name: Retry PAN verification
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/pan/{{plutusPanCardId}}/retry-verification
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.statusCode: isDefined
}

docs {
  `PANCardResource.retryVerification` (VAHN_ADMIN, TORG_ADMIN) -> `PANCardService.retryVerification`:
  re-runs the Surepass check. 400 "PAN Card is already verified" if VERIFIED; 404 if unknown. When the
  retry verifies the PAN, BUG-108's recompute runs. On staging Surepass fails for test PANs and the endpoint answers statusCode 500 "There was an error
  processing your request" in the body (the Surepass failure is rethrown as a RuntimeException, not a
  BadRequest), never VERIFIED.
}
